# Netlify reads this file in preference to netlify.toml, so a rule missing here
# is a route that 404s even though the toml looks right.
#
# Cloudflare honours this file too, but wrangler.toml sets run_worker_first for
# /api/*, which runs before any asset logic — so the function rules below never
# apply there. The catch-all is correct on both.
#
# Order matters: the catch-all is last, or it would swallow the API paths.

/api/chat          /.netlify/functions/chat          200
/api/reservations  /.netlify/functions/reservations  200
/api/health        /.netlify/functions/health        200
/*                 /index.html                       200
